---
import ApertureIcon from './ApertureIcon.astro';
---
<section class="sec-block">
	<div class="kicker sec-anim">
		<ApertureIcon />
		<span>Alur Booking</span>
	</div>
	
	<div class="mb-[36px] sec-anim">
		<h2 class="font-display text-[26px] font-bold tracking-tight mb-[8px]">Cara booking</h2>
		<p class="text-text-muted text-[15px] max-w-[560px] font-body">
			Empat langkah dari pilih ruangan sampai hari pemotretan.
		</p>
	</div>
	
	<div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-[16px] sec-anim">
		<div class="py-[20px] border-t-2 border-accent">
			<div class="font-display font-extrabold text-[26px] text-accent mb-[6px]">01</div>
			<h4 class="font-title font-bold text-[15px] mb-[6px]">Pilih ruangan</h4>
			<p class="text-[13.5px] text-text-muted font-body">Bandingkan Studio 01 dan 02 sesuai gaya visual yang dibutuhkan.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="py-[20px] border-t-2 border-accent">
			<div class="font-display font-extrabold text-[26px] text-accent mb-[6px]">02</div>
			<h4 class="font-title font-bold text-[15px] mb-[6px]">Pilih jam & tanggal</h4>
			<p class="text-[13.5px] text-text-muted font-body">Cek slot yang tersedia dan kunci jadwal secara langsung.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="py-[20px] border-t-2 border-accent">
			<div class="font-display font-extrabold text-[26px] text-accent mb-[6px]">03</div>
			<h4 class="font-title font-bold text-[15px] mb-[6px]">Bayar DP</h4>
			<p class="text-[13.5px] text-text-muted font-body">DP 50% mengunci slot Anda, sisanya dibayar di hari-H.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="py-[20px] border-t-2 border-accent">
			<div class="font-display font-extrabold text-[26px] text-accent mb-[6px]">04</div>
			<h4 class="font-title font-bold text-[15px] mb-[6px]">Datang & shoot</h4>
			<p class="text-[13.5px] text-text-muted font-body">Asisten sudah standby, alat sudah menyala saat Anda tiba.</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>